; regression/coverage test: numbers.kurt's transitivity axioms ("lt-trans" et al.) had never been
; exercised by any real proof anywhere in the repo before this file (confirmed by grep: only 2
; files loaded numbers.kurt at all, and neither used the order theory). Chains two applications of
; "lt-trans" (kurt's derivation is single-hop, so a<b<c<d needs an explicit intermediate a<c
; step) to prove a<d from three separately-`use`d strict inequalities.
load numbers
var a, b, c, d

use a < b
use b < c
use c < d

a < b and b < c
a < c
a < c and c < d
a < d
